{"id":"guapo","es":"guapo","en":["good-looking","handsome"],"pos":"adjective","topic":"describing","note":"For both sexes. In Colombia also brave.","sent":{"es":"Tu novio es muy {guapo}.","en":"Your boyfriend is very good-looking."}}
